conclusion	Generate usage activity summary and unified session	2026-10-21T18:19:26.3051146Z   - **Assessment:** I classed it as intended Black style rather than a bug. `my_var == 999 if abc == "TEST" else 0` already parses as `(my_var == 999) if abc == "TEST" else 0`, so the formatted code means the same as the original. The reporter's "original" reading would need the parenthesised form `my_var == (999 if ...)`.
